  <h2>What brides choose from</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Diamond necklace sets, in natural or lab-grown diamonds</li>
    <li>Polki and Jadau chokers, long necklaces and full sets</li>
    <li>Mangalsutras, engagement and wedding rings</li>
