  <h2>How we plan a bridal set</h2>
  <p>Share your outfits, colours and budget with us. We shortlist designs from over 3,000 pieces, adjust the gold karat, diamond quality and design where needed, and make the final pieces in-house.</p>

  <h2>Certified and hallmarked</h2>
  <p>Diamonds come with certificates from recognised laboratories such as IGI, TGL and EGL where applicable; gold jewellery is BIS HUID hallmarked.</p>

  <h2>Families outside Surat</h2>
  <p>We regularly help families shopping from other cities through video calls, with NEFT or UPI payment and free insured delivery to major Indian cities. See <a href="/delivery-across-india">Delivery across India</a>.</p>
